<title>USA: TABLE - Provident Cos Q2 oper net, shr up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Provident Cos Q2 oper net, shr up.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.83		    $0.75</p>
<p> Net		 58,700		   37,400</p>
<p> Revs		992,300		  574,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  67,074		   45,508</p>
<p>	  6   MONTH</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.58		    $1.45</p>
<p> Net		 96,400		   72,200</p>
<p> Revs		1,558,900		1,166,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  56,896		   45,472</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Revenue, net and share figures exclude after-tax investment gains of $1 million, or $0.01 per share, in 1997 Q2 and losses of $3.3 million, or $0.07 per share, in 1996 Q2.</p>
<p>Including these gains and losses, 1997 Q2 net was $59.7 million or $0.84 per share, and 1996 Q2 net was $34.1 million, or $0.68 per share.</p>
<p>Including these gains and losses, 1997 six-month net was $100.5 million, or $1.66 per share, and 1996 six-month net was $68.5 million, or $1.37 per share.</p>
